  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  translationName: Second tutorial window
  FallbackText: "At start you can only collect Iron but after upgrading the weapon
    you can collect more rare resources. \nPlease return all the resources you collect
    to the Selling plane to receive gold.\nGold is our main currency for upgrade.\nAlso
    after every upgrade you will receive additional crate with gold to help you reach
    the goal faster!"
